# Build-time tooling only — never installed into a runtime image.
#
# These pins make wheel/sdist builds reproducible: PEP 517 builds run with
# `--no-build-isolation` against exactly these versions instead of resolving
# an unconstrained build backend from the network on every build.
#
# Regenerate requirements-build.lock with:
#
#    pip-compile --generate-hashes --allow-unsafe \
#        --output-file=requirements-build.lock requirements-build.in
#
# Floor is the first release without GHSA-xmj3-9gf7-h52w.
